    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d687">

                <pb facs="0764" n="684" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg684"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Iddings to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1902-09-06"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">September 6,
                    1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your unnumbered instruction of
                    August 12 last, and to the Department’s circular<anchor n="a" xml:id="d687-f1"/>
                    of August 11, I have the honor to report that, as directed, I have to-day shown
                    to the minister for foreign affairs the communication concerning the treatment
                    of Jews in Roumania, and at his request left a copy of the same with him.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lewis Morris
                    Iddings.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
